# Production origin, no trailing slash. Drives canonical URLs, Open Graph URLs,
# the sitemap and the footer label printed inside generated PDFs.
#
# Only needed if the site moves to a custom domain — the default in
# src/lib/site.ts already matches the current production origin. Set it under
# Netlify → Site configuration → Environment variables, then redeploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://printable-sudoku.netlify.app
